### Executability of the d039-CLI x 41392c011-extension pairing

This pairing was never previously executed, so each cross-version dependency
was checked directly.

1. Unregistered GUC `SET`. `distann_multicluster.rs:9231-9235` unconditionally
   issues `SET ec_distann.benchmark_fast_real_array_send = off` immediately
   before `run_materialization_correctness`. Main does not register it:

   ```text
   $ git show 41392c011:src/am/ec_distann/options.rs | grep -n "benchmark_"
   450 ec_distann.benchmark_head_policy
   459 ec_distann.benchmark_training_query_path
   468 ec_distann.benchmark_exact_neighbor
   477 ec_distann.benchmark_traversal_replica_fail_batch
   488 ec_distann.benchmark_materialization_batch_size
   499 ec_distann.benchmark_owner_payload_plan_cache
   508 ec_distann.benchmark_typed_locator
   517 ec_distann.benchmark_packed_payload
   526 ec_distann.benchmark_expanded_locator
   535 ec_distann.benchmark_payload_projection
   658 ec_distann.benchmark_seed_mode
   667 ec_distann.benchmark_head_search_width
   678 ec_distann.benchmark_head_seed_count
   (no benchmark_fast_real_array_send)

   $ grep -rn "mark_guc_prefix_reserved\|MarkGUCPrefixReserved" src/ crates/
   (no matches)
   ```

   The `ec_distann` prefix is not reserved, so PostgreSQL accepts the `SET` as
   a placeholder. Independently corroborated by packet-001 seq02's Task 199
   precedent (`reviews/task-199/003-release-matrix-and-decision/artifacts/repeat-50k/normal-release-ab-50k/distann-multinode-summary.log:76-83`).

2. New SQL-exposed functions in the Task 224 delta are never called by the CLI:

   ```text
   $ git diff 41392c011..d03997c7a -- src/ | grep "^+.*pg_extern" -A1
   +fn ec_distann_profile_binary_send(value: AnyElement) -> Vec<u8>
   +fn ec_distann_fast_real_array_send(value: AnyElement) -> Vec<u8>

   $ grep -n "ec_distann_profile_binary_send\|ec_distann_fast_real_array_send" \
       crates/ecaz-cli/src/commands/dev/distann_multicluster.rs
   (no matches)
   ```

3. New stage-counter labels (indices 37-39, plus appended
   `DistannMaterializationWork` variants) are not required by the CLI. The only
   mention of `owner_requested_tids` is a comment at `:8515`, inside the
   `args.owner_fast_real_array_send` branch (`:8518`), which is off.

4. Preflight does not require runner SHA == extension SHA.
   `validate_extension_preflight` (`:477-544`) checks cross-node unanimity,
   `build_profile == "release"`, and absence of `pg-test` only.
   `validate_query_stage_counter_feature` (`:547-560`) additionally requires
   `distann-head-attribution-benchmark`, which the pinned install command
   provides.

5. The new attestation reads `ec_distann.benchmark_materialization_batch_size`
   (`materialization_batch_size_setting`, `:2966-2988`), which main registers
   under the attribution feature (`options.rs:488`).

6. The emitted per-row provenance suffix takes `extension_git_sha` from the
   preflight result (`:9217-9224`), so rows will carry
   `extension_git_sha=41392c011...`, directly comparable to packet 001's rows.

